  // Graphics presets (see src/Strata.Core/Presentation/GraphicsConfig.cs for every field and its range).
  // Chosen in Settings > Video (or `graphics <preset>` / --graphics=<preset>); the choice is remembered. Medium is the
  // default: high and ultra add screen-space GI, reflections and volumetric fog that need a strong GPU.
  // Ultra is tuned for 60 fps at 1080p on an RX 6600 / RTX 2060-class card: the costly screen-space passes run at
